      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-10-07",
      "text": "The acting director said the department had more staff turnover than it usually sees.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "yMbc5cKnAGk",
        "ts": "0:13:03",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-11T05:47:59.118Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-10-07",
      "text": "The acting director said the county does not do enough exit interviews to learn why employees leave.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "yMbc5cKnAGk",
        "ts": "0:10:14",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-11T05:47:59.118Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-02",
      "text": "Staff said the consultant has done 46 interviews, with 20 more scheduled.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "tTdredHGJvc",
        "ts": "1:02:25",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:04:03.757Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-02",
      "text": "Staff said a consultant's review covers recruitment and hiring, classification, and reorganization.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "tTdredHGJvc",
        "ts": "0:57:16",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:04:03.757Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-02",
      "text": "She said a recent focus has been recruiting, because the County has many vacancies.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "tTdredHGJvc",
        "ts": "0:18:26",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:04:03.757Z"
      },
      "body": "Civil Service Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-30",
      "text": "The committee deferred the item (set it aside for later) with no objections.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "cTo0JuqhG5A",
        "ts": "2:08:38",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T15:46:03.906Z"
      },
      "body": "County Council Kōmike Aloha ʻĀina"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-30",
      "text": "The managing director said the team will come back to the committee as often as members want.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "cTo0JuqhG5A",
        "ts": "1:57:51",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T15:46:03.906Z"
      },
      "body": "County Council Kōmike Aloha ʻĀina"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-30",
      "text": "The managing director said people can email the project team with ideas and questions.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "cTo0JuqhG5A",
        "ts": "1:38:09",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T15:46:03.906Z"
      },
      "body": "County Council Kōmike Aloha ʻĀina"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-30",
      "text": "Guidehouse said it has not yet met with the Civil Service Commission, which is on its list.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "cTo0JuqhG5A",
        "ts": "1:34:51",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T15:46:03.906Z"
      },
      "body": "County Council Kōmike Aloha ʻĀina"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-30",
      "text": "The contract is for two years, with an option to extend for three more one-year terms.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "cTo0JuqhG5A",
        "ts": "1:34:25",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T15:46:03.906Z"
      },
      "body": "County Council Kōmike Aloha ʻĀina"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-30",
      "text": "Guidehouse said a formal pay study is outside this project.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "cTo0JuqhG5A",
        "ts": "1:24:38",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T15:46:03.906Z"
      },
      "body": "County Council Kōmike Aloha ʻĀina"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-30",
      "text": "Guidehouse said past projects cut hiring time by 30 percent, and maybe even 50 percent.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "cTo0JuqhG5A",
        "ts": "0:51:09",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T15:46:03.906Z"
      },
      "body": "County Council Kōmike Aloha ʻĀina"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-30",
      "text": "A testifier said hiring managers want more pay flexibility, and the rules already allow a lot of it.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "cTo0JuqhG5A",
        "ts": "0:41:31",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T15:46:03.906Z"
      },
      "body": "County Council Kōmike Aloha ʻĀina"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-30",
      "text": "The team has done 10 interviews and 8 working sessions so far.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "cTo0JuqhG5A",
        "ts": "0:24:45",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T15:46:03.906Z"
      },
      "body": "County Council Kōmike Aloha ʻĀina"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-30",
      "text": "They said year two focuses on putting changes in place, with training and support.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "cTo0JuqhG5A",
        "ts": "0:23:52",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T15:46:03.906Z"
      },
      "body": "County Council Kōmike Aloha ʻĀina"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-30",
      "text": "She said the goals include faster and more transparent hiring.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "cTo0JuqhG5A",
        "ts": "0:10:02",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T15:46:03.906Z"
      },
      "body": "County Council Kōmike Aloha ʻĀina"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-30",
      "text": "The personnel services director said Align HR reviews how county human resources (HR) services are organized and delivered.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "cTo0JuqhG5A",
        "ts": "0:09:49",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T15:46:03.906Z"
      },
      "body": "County Council Kōmike Aloha ʻĀina"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-30",
      "text": "She said the county budget grew from $736 million in 2010 to $1.6 billion today.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "cTo0JuqhG5A",
        "ts": "0:07:36",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T15:46:03.906Z"
      },
      "body": "County Council Kōmike Aloha ʻĀina"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-01",
      "text": "Departments have sent only 335 requests to fill vacant positions.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "qrQsEpbjdgA",
        "ts": "0:31:49",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-13T06:35:23.239Z"
      }
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-01",
      "text": "The director agreed to give the commission a breakdown of the open positions.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "qrQsEpbjdgA",
        "ts": "0:31:44",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-13T06:35:23.239Z"
      }
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-01",
      "text": "The county has 962 open positions.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "qrQsEpbjdgA",
        "ts": "0:30:17",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-13T06:35:23.239Z"
      }
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-01",
      "text": "The commission's legal counsel will report back on whether commissioners working with the consultant can give a summary after each meeting.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "qrQsEpbjdgA",
        "ts": "0:20:15",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-13T06:35:23.239Z"
      }
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-01",
      "text": "The department's new consultant plans to present its work to county leaders July 13.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "qrQsEpbjdgA",
        "ts": "0:15:34",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-13T06:35:23.239Z"
      }
    }
